        "TileImage": "$($repository ea638c1b-d4e5-42c9-bf70-e4b2825a846e).Image",
        "Description": "On September 14th of this year, 4 Kronstadt employees wound up dead in their own research facility with their 5th colleague missing. Unbeknownst to his peers, this 5th colleague is a member of an extremely dangerous cult. Soon after working on new technologies at Kronstadt, colleagues from other departments noticed he had changed. It is believed on this day he &quot;snapped&quot; and killed his colleagues sacrificially. Somehow, he also managed to escape without alerting anyone else or the cameras.",
